  "notes": "{漬|つ}け{込|こ}む emphasizes thorough soaking for extended periods.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- タレに{漬|つ}け{込|こ}む: to marinate in sauce\n- {一晩|ひとばん}{漬|つ}け{込|こ}む: to marinate overnight\n- {調味料|ちょうみりょう}に{漬|つ}け{込|こ}む: to soak in seasonings\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {漬|つ}ける: to soak, to pickle (general)\n- マリネする: to marinate (loanword)\n- {塩漬|しおづ}け: salting, pickling in salt\n\nUSAGE:\nDifferent from {付|つ}け{込|こ}む which means \"to take advantage of.\"",
